      <h1 class="ed-title">Best Treadmills With a 60-Inch Deck</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Sixty inches is the length most runners need: long enough that a full stride at speed does not take you near the front of the motor hood or off the back. Here are seven treadmills with a 60-inch running surface, from an $800 folding machine to a 22-inch-wide Spirit, each with its deck size confirmed by the maker or its listing.
      </p>
      <p class="ed-answer"><strong>Short answer.</strong> Best Budget: <a href="#horizon-t202">Horizon T202</a>. Best Value: <a href="#horizon-7-0-at">Horizon 7.0 AT</a>. Best Sole: <a href="#sole-f63">Sole F63</a>.</p>

      <!-- Byline -->
