          7.4 AT at about $1,500. We have not tested these treadmills hands-on. Deck sizes and specifications come from
          each maker&rsquo;s site or the Amazon listing, checked on 21 and 22 November 2026.
        </p>

        <section id="top-picks" class="ed-toppicks not-prose">
